      <div type="clause" n="16.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 16.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>And na<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="12" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.12"/> þearf man na fæstan fram Eastran oð Pentecosten, butan<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.1"/> hwa gescrifen<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="13" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.13"/> sig<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.3"/> oððe he elles fæstan<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="14" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.14"/> wylle; eallswa<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="15" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.15"/> of middanwintra<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="16" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.16"/> oð octabas Epiphanige<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="17" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.17"/> (þ<hi rend="italic">æt<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="*" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.star"/></hi> is seofen niht ofer Twelftan mæssedæge).</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>⁊ na ðearf man na fæsten fram Eastron oð Pentecosten, buton hwa gescrifen sy oððe he elles fæsten wylle, ⁊ of middanwintre oð octabas Epiphanie.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-a"><pb n="296" ed="#liebermann"/>And ne þearf man fæsten fra<hi rend="italic">m</hi> Eastran oð Pentecosten, buton hwa gescryfen sy oððe he elles wille fæsten, and of middanwintra oð octabas Epiphanie.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>Non<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="3" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.3-2"/> sunt secundum legem indicta ieiunia a Pascha usque ad<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="4" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.4"/> Pentecosten nec á natali Domini usque ad octauas Epiphanię<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="5" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.5"/>, nisi qui<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="6" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.6"/> per penitentiam uel<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="7" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.7"/> sponte ieiunet.<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.8"/></ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-inst-cn"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>A Pascha tamen usque Pentecosten nullus ieiunet, nisi sit preceptum pro<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="8" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.8-2"/> publica pęnitentia; a die etiam natiuitatis<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="9" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.9"/> Domini usque ad octauas<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="10" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.oe.10"/> Epiphanię idem custodiatur.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="16.1" corresp="#wit-cons-cn"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>[16, 1] A Pascha tamen usque ad Pentecosten non oportet ieiunium obseruare, nisi penitencie satisfactione uel ultro ieiunare uelit; sic et a natali Domini usque ad octauam Teophanie.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="16a.1" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="166" ed="#robertson"/>⁊ na ðearf man na fæsten<ptr type="editorNote" n="13" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.fn.13"/> fram Eastron oð Pentecosten, buton hwa gescrifen sy oððe he elles fæsten<ptr type="editorNote" n="13" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.fn.13"/> wylle, ⁊<ptr type="editorNote" n="14" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.fn.14"/> of middanwintre oð octabas Epiphanie<ptr type="editorNote" n="15" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.fn.15"/>.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="246" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And na þearf man na fæstan fram Eastran oð Pentecosten butan hwa gescrifen sig oððe he elles fæstan wylle; eallswa of middanwintra oð octabas Epiphanige, þæt is seofen niht ofer Twelftan mæssedæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="297" ed="#liebermann"/>Und<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="1" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.de.1"/> man braucht nicht zu fasten von Ostern bis Pfingsten — ausser wenn einer mit Kirchenbusse<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="2" target="#ICn_16-1.lnote.de.2"/> belegt ist oder er sonst [freiwillig] fasten will — und (ebenso <hi rend="italic">G</hi>) von Weihnachten bis Octave Epiphaniae (d. h. sieben Tage nach dem Zwölften [nach 6. Januar] Festtag <hi rend="italic">G</hi>).</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And there is no need to fast from Easter until Pentecost — unless someone has been given penance or otherwise [voluntarily] wishes to fast — and (likewise, G) from midwinter until the octave of Epiphany (that is, seven days after Twelfth Day [6 January], G).</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b"><pb n="167" ed="#robertson"/>And no man need fast from Easter till Pentecost— unless it has been prescribed to him<ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.n.1"/> as a penance or he desires to fast for some other reason—or from Christmas to the Octave of Epiphany<ptr type="editorNote" n="2" target="#ICn_16-1.robnote.n.2"/>.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-g-a"><pb n="247" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And no one need fast between Easter and Pentecost unless it has been assigned as a penance or he otherwise wishes to fast; or from Christmas until the eighth day of Epiphany, that is, seven days after the Twelfth Night.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="297"><ref target="clause:VIAtr_22-3">VI Atr 22.3</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">*Vgl. VI Atr. 22, 3</note>
        <note type="editorial">G's ‘(þæt is seofon niht ofer Twelftan mæssedæge)’ is only in G and not original. Liebermann compares VI Atr 22.3.; Robertson (p. 139) takes I Cn from B, which begins at ‘mæssedæg’ in 14.2, the earlier clauses being supplied from G; BR: added from Gesetze I p. 297, October 2026 (MS Cons)</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">eallswa: and AB</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">þæt . . . mæssedæge: omitted AB</note>
        <note type="translator" source="#rabin-doml">Epiphany: An eight-day festival beginning on January 19.</note>
